{"id":"vod_bf_82402","vodId":"82402","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"龙珠Z（国语版）","name_cn":"龙珠Z（国语版）","date":"1989-01-01","year":"1989","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20250115-1/58ee3f03d6e802c4700bc2699ece78af.webp"},"summary":"结束了与新短笛大魔王的天下第一比武大会，我们的地球迎来了长达五年的和平时期，数次拯救世界的孙悟空（野泽雅子 饰）在此期间与琪琪走入婚姻殿堂，并生下了可爱的儿子悟饭。然而更大的危机一波又一波向勇敢的战士们袭来。打头阵的赛亚人拉迪兹，意外揭开了悟空的身世。宿命的对手贝吉塔则 让悟空真正见识到高手的存在。在此之后，那美克星、弗利札、超级赛亚人、人造人、未来少年、魔人布欧。精彩戏码接连上演，拉开了龙珠Z的宏大篇章……                                                                    　　本片根据日本漫画家鸟山明的同名经典原著改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 15:53:57","playable":true,"episodeCount":291,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/longzhuZguoyuban/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/longzhuZguoyuban/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/longzhuZguoyuban/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/longzhuZguoyuban/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/longzhuZguoyuban/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/longzhuZguoyuban/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/longzhuZguoyuban/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/longzhuZguoyuban/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/longzhuZguoyuban/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/longzhuZguoyuban/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/longzhuZguoyuban/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/longzhuZguoyuban/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/longzhuZguoyuban/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"ht